  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN239.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">poruḷvayiṟ pirintu pōkāniṉṟa talaimakaṉ ṟaṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE, who was going after having parted for the sake of wealth, said to his heart.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN239.1">
        <l>aḷitō <supplied>tā</supplied>ṉē yevaṉā vatuko<supplied>ṉ</supplied></l>
        <l>maṉṟun tōṉṟātu maraṉu māyum</l>
        <l>puliyeṉa vulampuñ ceṅka ṇāṭavar</l>
        <l>ñe<supplied>li</supplied>yoṭu piṭitta vārkō lampi<supplied>ṉa</supplied></l>
        <l>rellū reṟintu pal<supplied>lā</supplied>t taḻīiya</l>
        <l>viḷiṭṭu pūcal veñcurat tiraṭṭum</l>
        <l><anchor n="1"/>vēṟupaṭupaḵ ṟōntāvattu <supplied>vū</supplied>ṟupala nīntip</l>
        <l>puḷḷit <supplied>to</supplied>yyiṟ poṟipaṭu cuṇaṅki</l>
        <l>ṉoḷḷiḻai makaḷi ruyarpiṟai toḻūum</l>
        <l>pulleṉ mālai yāmiva ṇoḻiya</l>
        <l><supplied>vī</supplied>ṭṭa<supplied>ru</supplied>ṅ kuraiya poruḷvayiṟ celiṉē</l>
        <l>nīṭṭuvi rallirō neṭuntakai yīreṉak</l>
        <l>kuṟuneṭum pulavi kūṟi nammoṭu</l>
        <l>nerunalun tīmpala moḻinta</l>
        <l>ciṟuna lorutti peruna lūrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">Pitiable it is. What will become of it?</l>
        <l corresp="2">The village common does not appear [anymore], and the trees are vanishing,</l>
        <l corresp="15">– of the big good village of one little good woman</l>
        <l corresp="14">who yesterday too spoke many sweet [words]</l>
        <l corresp="13">to us, talking short [and] long in [her] vexation:</l>
        <l corresp="11d">“if,</l>
        <l corresp="7">crossing obstacles many in the distress of many variable shortages,</l>
        <l corresp="6b-d">where in the hot desert clamour sounds loudly when</l>
        <l corresp="3">red-eyed men who roar like tigers,</l>
        <l corresp="4">having arrows with long shafts that they grip along with the grating bamboo,</l>
        <l corresp="5-6a">attacking villages at night [and] shouting in order to get hold of many cows,</l>
        <l corresp="10">while we stay behind for bleak evenings,</l>
        <l>when women with bright jewels [and] beauty marks that show between spots</l>
        <l corresp="8f">of sandal paste in dots(?) worship the high crescent moon,</l>
        <l rend="indent2" corresp="11">you go for the sake of wealth difficult to amass,</l>
        <l corresp="12">you will delay, won’t you, [my] paragon?”</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

